        "content": "## Calendly: cancellation → HubSpot\nCalled by **Calendly - poll bookings** for a booking whose HubSpot meeting is still SCHEDULED but is cancelled in Calendly.\n\n- Reschedule (`rescheduled: true`): outcome RESCHEDULED, nothing else (the new time arrives as a new booking).\n- Real cancellation: outcome CANCELED, Slack note, and the deal moves from Call booked back to Contacted (only from Call booked).",
